      "track": "assets/music/my_little_world.ogg",
      "volume": 0.6,
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 2,
      "next": "n3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Festival day. The school grounds are alive with color -- banners strung between buildings, booths lining the walkways, and students everywhere.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air smells like fried food and fresh paint. Laughter drifts from every direction. It almost feels like a different school.",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But somewhere beneath the excitement, a knot sits heavy in your stomach. Today is the day. The performance.",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You weave through the crowd toward the club room, passing students hawking takoyaki and handing out flyers.",
      "next": "n7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/club1/day1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.8,
      "next": "n8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The club room door is already open. Inside, the air is thick with tension.",
      "next": "n9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "nervous_smile",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "nervous_smile",
      "text": "Oh, you're here! I was starting to think I got the time wrong. I've checked the setlist like twelve times already.",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "slide_left",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Twelve times, huh. That's restraint for you.",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "transition": "slide_right",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "Good morning! Can you feel it? The whole school is buzzing.",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hanami is smiling, but her skin is pale and there are faint shadows under her eyes. She's holding her water bottle with both hands, like she needs the anchor.",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/door_slam.wav",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "next": "n17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "slide_left",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Alright. Everyone's here. Good.",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany sets a clipboard on the desk. It's covered in color-coded notes, timestamps, and arrows. She's been up all night.",
      "next": "n20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "I've mapped out every minute. Warm-up at ten. Sound check at ten-thirty. We're in the third performance slot, so we go on at one-fifteen sharp.",
      "next": "n21"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "No one leaves this room until we've run through the set at least twice. No exceptions.",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Twice? We've rehearsed this a hundred times. We know the songs.",
      "next": "n23"
    },
    {
      "id": "n23",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Knowing and executing are two different things. I'm not leaving anything to chance.",
      "next": "n24"
    },
    {
      "id": "n24",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "nervous_smile",
      "text": "It's okay, I don't mind practicing more. Better safe than sorry, right?",
      "next": "n25"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "text": "Tiffany... try to breathe. We're going to be wonderful.",
      "next": "n26"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany's jaw tightens. She looks at each of you in turn, measuring, calculating.",
      "next": "n27"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "This is our moment. Everything we've worked for comes down to today. So let's make it count.",
      "next": "n28"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's a pep talk. Or it's supposed to be. But the way she says it feels less like encouragement and more like a command.",
      "next": "n29"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "We've got this, together.",
          "target": "n30_unite"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's just do our best.",
          "target": "n30_pressure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n30_unite",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "We've got this. All of us, together. That's what makes this work.",
      "next": "n31_unite_trust1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31_unite_trust1",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "tiffany_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n31_unite_trust2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31_unite_trust2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "hanami_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n31_unite_trust3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31_unite_trust3",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "cassian_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n31_unite_trust4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31_unite_trust4",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "laura_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n32_unite_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32_unite_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "...Right. Together.",
      "next": "n35_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n30_pressure",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Let's just do our best. That's all anyone can ask.",
      "next": "n31_pressure_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31_pressure_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "hanami_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n31_pressure_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31_pressure_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "tiffany_rot",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n32_pressure_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32_pressure_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "\"Our best\" isn't a plan. But... fine.",
      "next": "n33_pressure_hanami"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33_pressure_hanami",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "I think that's the right way to look at it.",
      "next": "n35_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35_converge",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The room settles into a focused quiet. Everyone picks up their instruments.",
      "next": "n36"
    },
    {
      "id": "n36",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Sound check. From the top. Cassian, count us in.",
      "next": "n37"
    },
    {
      "id": "n37",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/countdown_beep.wav",
      "volume": 0.6,
      "next": "n38"
    },
    {
      "id": "n38",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/guitar_strum.wav",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "next": "n39"
    },
    {
      "id": "n39",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first notes ring out, filling the small room. It's rough at the edges, but it's real. It's yours.",
      "next": "n40"
    },
    {
      "id": "n40",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/piano_chord.wav",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "next": "n41"
    },
    {
      "id": "n41",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hanami's fingers find the keys with practiced grace. Laura's voice wavers for a moment, then steadies. Cassian's guitar carries them all.",
      "next": "n42"
    },
    {
      "id": "n42",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "Good. That was good. One more time, and we'll be ready.",
      "next": "n43"
    },
    {
      "id": "n43",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_flag",
      "flag": "flags.festival_day",
      "value": true,
      "next": "n44"
    },
    {
      "id": "n44",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The festival waits outside. The crowd is gathering. In a few hours, you'll be on stage.",
      "next": "n45"
    },
    {
      "id": "n45",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Whatever happens next, there's no turning back.",
      "next": "n46"
    },
    {
      "id": "n46",
      "type": "end",
      "next_scene": "scenes/act3/scene2_generated.json"
    }
  ]
}
